# Every form of the events file (STATE.md 6.2), for an image that never
# reads its queue (spin), so the state holds each event as appended.
# Lines out of frame order; events of a frame stay in the order written.
2 press 5          # a single digit is the key 5 (22h), not usage 5
2 press 05         # two digits are a usage ID
2 down F12 shift ctrl alt meta
2 up Escape control
2 press 0x28
0 text a#b c	tab
0 pointer 700 9999 7     # clamped to 639, 479
0 click 640 3
0 wheel -127 127
0 wheel 5
1 feeds-updated
1 feeds-updated          # dropped: at most one a frame
1 home                   # a system's only: dropped for a machine alone
1 pad 0 0x2001 -127 127
1 pad 3 ffff 1 -1 2 -2
3 pad 0 off
3 text
3 press PAGEDOWN
3 press z
4 down 255
# a comment line
   # an indented one
